==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*10 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be pretty easy if you have some high-level damage dealers/[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. Make sure to bring enough meatshields to stop J.K. Bun Bun from advancing. You can bring any anti-Red/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] you have.

Send out a couple Can Cans to stall the first Dark Emperor Santa and get some knockbacks. After J.K. Bun Bun spawns, start meatshielding and send out your damage dealers and Ubers.

